# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# A chosen Desktop label carries its own darker band -- the backdrop IS
# the selection blue, so the old fill vanished into it -- and the colour
# is a preference, reachable from the Deskbar's Tracker preferences.
wait 12
expect-pixel 546 68 336698
click 531 33
wait 3
expect-desk-selected-name .Trash
note the label band is the preference's deep navy, not the backdrop blue
expect-pixel 546 68 1a3350
click 980 20
wait 2
click 780 110
wait 5
note the swatch walks the colour wheel: after navy comes black
click 432 268
wait 3
key w ctrl
wait 3
expect-pixel 546 68 000000
quit
